WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.084
I'm sorry to report that the

00:00:01.084 --> 00:00:02.460
new Cold War between China

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:03.962
and the United States has reached

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:04.921
the pandas.

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:06.715
These very cute, lovely

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:08.383
giant pandas are famous

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:10.176
and they are down the street at the zoo

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:11.386
in Washington, D.C.

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:12.846
and they have been since the ‘70s

00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.556
when Richard Nixon went to China,

00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:16.141
and as a gesture of friendship,

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:18.560
China gave us two pandas.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.730
[Pat Nixon] I am pleased to accept the precious gift

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:22.856
of the panda

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:24.024
from the government

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.109
of the People's Republic of China.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:27.861
We've had these two pandas at our zoo

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.821
for the last 50 years,

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:31.364
and now they're going home forever.

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.198
China practices

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.575
panda diplomacy,

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:34.993
giving pandas to countries

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:35.535
around the world

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:36.369
that they're friends with.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.662
If you make China mad,

00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:38.955
they might take away your pandas.

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:39.789
And that's potentially

00:00:39.789 --> 00:00:40.665
what's going on here.

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:42.000
No one knows exactly why they didn't

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.626
renew the lease for the pandas

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:44.586
to stay at our zoo.

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:45.628
but many experts think that it's

00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:46.504
because of the rising

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:46.880
tensions

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.339
between the United States and China.

00:00:48.339 --> 00:00:49.424
So, if you're here in D.C.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.009
and you love pandas,

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:51.676
you've got a few more

00:00:51.676 --> 00:00:52.802
months to say goodbye.

